cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ProteoTrace, please cite the software and version used."
title: "ProteoTrace: proteomics-only sample-consistency QC for longitudinal cohorts"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yuliantoro"
    given-names: "Herbi"
    email: "hey325@lehigh.edu"
    affiliation: "Lehigh University"
version: 0.3.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/herbiyuliantoro/proteotrace"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - quality control
  - sample consistency
  - longitudinal cohorts
  - batch correction
abstract: >-
  ProteoTrace compares protein-abundance profiles across longitudinal
  mass-spectrometry runs and flags runs that differ from their assigned donors.
  It does not require genotype data.
